WEBVTT

00:05:58.829 --> 00:06:03.579
I should have just let him go. Escalation
of commitment happens in every workplace.

00:06:04.079 --> 00:06:06.538
I think about the times when
you overinvested in

00:06:06.538 --> 00:06:09.746
a failing project stuck around
in a miserable job.

00:06:09.746 --> 00:06:13.871
I struggled to walk away from an
abusive boss or a toxic culture

00:06:14.829 --> 00:06:18.079
or even away from work. Poured
your heart and soul into

00:06:18.079 --> 00:06:20.663
a romantic relationship that
clearly wasn't working.

00:06:21.496 --> 00:06:23.288
So why don't we know better?

00:06:24.038 --> 00:06:26.871
Why do we fall into the same
trap again and again,

00:06:27.246 --> 00:06:29.746
pouring more and more of ourselves
into a bad decision,